    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102650" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταφήϊος, λίθος</span>
			
			<i>grave</i>stone, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.40
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Diod.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφια, τά</span>, <i>burial-place,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(1).736
			</span></i> (Camirus, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>): but also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾶν ταφιᾶν</span> (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταφία</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταφιά</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				3.674<i>A</i>4
			</span></i>, al. (Rhodes, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>).</div>
